        "text": "Material identity. Confirm the species, plant part and traceable starting lot."
      },
      {
        "file": "en-2.mp3",
        "duration": 6.312,
        "text": "Pretreatment. Drying or size reduction may prepare the material for extraction."
      },
      {
        "file": "en-3.mp3",
        "duration": 6.6,
        "text": "Extraction. A selected medium transfers soluble constituents from the material."
      },
      {
        "file": "en-4.mp3",
        "duration": 6.408,
        "text": "Separation. Filtration or centrifugation can remove suspended solids."
      },
      {
        "file": "en-5.mp3",
        "duration": 7.296,
        "text": "Concentrate / purify. Remove solvent; use selective separation only where needed."
      },
      {
        "file": "en-6.mp3",
